          {
            "title": "Question: Access element",
            "id": 79467,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jak uzyskać dostęp do pierwszego elementu tej listy?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"test_scores = [\" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"85\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>test_scores[0]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>test_scores[1]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>test_scores[90]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>test_scores[0]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Które wyrażenie pobierze <code>85</code> z listy po wykonaniu <code>test_scores.pop(0)</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"test_scores = [\" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"85\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">test_scores[0]</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">test_scores[1]</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">test_scores[85]</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz test_scores[0].</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Valid index",
            "id": 79569,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Użyj indeksu <code>2</code>, aby zaktualizować ostatni smak lodów na <code>\"strawberry\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"flavors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;pistachio&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"flavors[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;strawberry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(flavors)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['vanilla', 'chocolate', 'strawberry']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Valid index",
            "id": 79514,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaki jest ostatni indeks, do którego możemy uzyskać dostęp na tej liście?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"color_scheme = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;lightBlue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;gray&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Które wyrażenie pobiera <code>\"gray\"</code> z tej listy?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"color_scheme = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;lightBlue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;gray&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>color_scheme[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>color_scheme[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>color_scheme[\"gray\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>color_scheme[2]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: End of the list",
            "id": 79605,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj <code>3</code> na końcu listy, wpisując kod <code>.append(3)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"trading_values = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"trading_values.append(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(trading_values)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"48\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>.append(3)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pop",
            "id": 79601,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co robi <code>.pop()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Usuwa ostatnią wartość z listy</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dodaje wartość do listy</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Usuwa losową wartość z listy</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Usuwa ostatnią wartość z listy.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Początkowo dana jest lista <code>colors = [\"red\", \"blue\"]</code>. Co będzie zapisane w <code>colors</code> po wykonaniu <code>colors.pop()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"red\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"blue\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"red\", \"blue\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>[\"red\"]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: insert",
            "id": 79604,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj <code>\"windy\"</code> na początku tej listy za pomocą <code>insert()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"forecast = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sunny&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;cloudy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"forecast.insert(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;windy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(forecast)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['windy', 'sunny', 'cloudy']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>insert</code>, następnie <code>0</code>, a potem <code>,</code>, <code>\"windy\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj <code>\"windy\"</code> na początku, aby lista wyświetliła <code>['windy', 'sunny', 'cloudy']</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"forecast = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sunny&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;cloudy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"forecast.insert(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"&quot;windy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(forecast)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"append\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;sunny&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['windy', 'sunny', 'cloudy']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>insert</code>, następnie <code>0</code>, <code>,</code> i na końcu <code>\"windy\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Pop",
            "id": 79619,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usuń ostatnią wartość z listy <code>quiz_answers</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"quiz_answers = [\" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quiz_answers.pop()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(quiz_answers)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"append()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"insert()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[False, False, True]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>pop()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usuń ostatnią wartość z listy <code>quiz_answers</code>, aby wyświetliła się lista <code>[False, False, True]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"quiz_answers = [\" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quiz_answers.pop()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(quiz_answers)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"append()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"insert()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop(0)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[False, False, True]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>pop()</code>.</p></body></html>",
